ove with tila tequila and she made her  first film appearance that same year as  a hooters girl and i now pronounce you  chuck and larry that same year it all  came crashing down when people noticed  some bizarre posts on her website  sympathizing with adolf hitler tequila  said that she had and we quote  learned the truth about the war and  insinuated that the nazi dictator was  merely misunderstood tequila attempted  to get her career back on track in 2015  by participating in the uk reality show  celebrity big brother but she was booted  out of the house when showrunners  learned of her nazi sympathizing the  disgraced internet personality has since  tried and failed to release a gospel  album and has been embroiled in a  custody battle for her child  being under the spotlight is second  nature for lindsay lohan who began  working as a child model when she was  just 3 years old when her recurring role  on the soap opera another world got her  noticed by executives at disney she was  doubly cast in the 1998 remake of the  parent trap which turned out to be a  surprise hit for the company the  red-headed actress became a teen  sensation in the years that followed  finding further success with freaky  friday herbie fully loaded and mean  girls  unfortunately lohan's hot streak would  come to an abrupt halt in 2007.  on may 26 lohan was rushed to the  hospital after getting into a car  accident in beverly hills the actress  had recently been discharged from the  wonderland center rehab facility in los  angeles for undisclosed problems but the  nature of these issues became all too  clear when lohan was charged with dui  possession of cocaine and misdemeanor  hit and run following the incident if  her career wasn't already damaged enough  it certainly was when she was arrested  on the same charges just two months  later that was just the beginning of a  string of car crashes arrests and stints  at rehab that would make lohan a  commonly mocked figure by the media the  severity of her downfall was highlighted  by the critical response to her next  film the widely panned i know who killed  me in this flick lohan once again takes  on two roles at once but this time her  performances won her multiple accolades  at the 2008 golden raspberry awards the  film took home a record eight razzies in  total  lohan's career isn't over though at the  time of this video's release in 2022  she's set to star in the festive netflix  film falling for christmas playing a  snobby heiress stricken with amnesia  bow-tied man-child pee-wee herman was  huge during the 1980s the subject of two  feature films and an emmy-winning  children's tv series however public  perception of the once beloved character  and the man behind him paul rubins  changed drastically in 1991 during a  visit with his parents in sarasota  florida rubens was arrested for indecent  exposure at an adult movie theater with  sheriff's deputies claiming that they  spotted him touching himself during the  film the actor who was 38 at the time  pleaded no contest and agreed to take  part in a new anti-drug campaign to  avoid a trial on the misdemeanor charge  peewee toys were pulled from shells  across the nation as reubens retreated  from the public eye entirely  disappearing for the remainder of the  90s reuben's attempted comeback at the  turn of the century was quickly thwarted  when more charges of a sexual nature  were brought against him acting on a tip  officers raided rubin's home and seized  thousands of items from a collection of  vintage gay erotica some of which  depicted minors in the nude rubens has  always denied that he owned any sexual  images of children but acknowledged that  since he tended to buy his collectibles  in bulk he could have possessed some  questionable material without even  realizing it regardless the tatters of  his reputation went up in flames it took  another decade before rubin's dared  return to the character for peewee's big  holiday on netflix the positive response  to his comeback is scant consolation for  a man who spent most of his career in  hiding because of a few serious lapses  in judgment  the scandal that led to the damaging of  ingrid bergman's career wasn't too  outrageous by 21st century standards but  the consequences of the affair lingered  through the rest of the actress's life  the star of casablanca and gaslight was  expected to be a typical woman of the  time married and happy to serve her  husband but in reality she was a free  spirit who wanted to sleep around just  like all her male co-stars did during  her marriage to neurosurgeon peter  lindstrom bergman began an affair with  roberto rosellini her director on  stramboli bergman loved rosalini and  when she got pregnant with his child she  left lindstrom and their daughter to run  off with the italian director while a  woman having an affair and divorcing her  daughter's father seems pretty tame  compared to the exploits of tila tequila  the america of 1950 was freaked out the  fervor went all the way to washington  when senator edwin c johnson proposed a  bill that would require movies to be  approved not just based on the moral  content of the film itself but the moral  character of the people involved in  their creation  johnson who had once considered bergman  his favorite actress claimed that  bergman was influencing americans  towards evil and tried to have her  banned from appearing in any future  american films bergman stayed out of the  country for eight years  and although she continued to work in  the industry her star status was  permanently damaged by an affair of the  heart  kiss me kiss miss if it were the last  time  once upon a time amanda bynes was on the  rise but that was a long time ago the  star of the amanda show and she's the  man ran afoul of drugs and alcoholic  many child stars before her but what  truly killed her career was her complete  and total twitter meltdown in the weeks  after her arrest bind's 2012 